/Title (Mastering this technique can truly help our ability to reharmonize melodies and come up with surprising harmonic pathways. For example, pick any famous melody of your choice, and choose a specific note in that melody. Quickly go over all the chordal possibilities \(Tiers 1, 2 and 3\) and experiment over that specific note. You are likely to find unique possibilities that you wouldnt hardly arrived at by traditional harmonic thinking.)
